reat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_faceless_facilitators.\" title=\"The faceless facilitators.\">The faceless facilitators.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/...and_then_a_detective_comes_in.\" title=\"...and then a detective comes in.\">...and then a detective comes in.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The gangsters of the sea.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27m_a_girl_who_likes_a_clean_line.\" title=\"I&#39;m a girl who likes a clean line.\">I'm a girl who likes a clean line.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Big_stupid_things.\" title=\"Big stupid things.\">Big stupid things.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_dance_as_old_as_time_itself.\" title=\"A dance as old as time itself.\">A dance as old as time itself.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Captain_Jackie_and_the_hotdog.\" title=\"Captain Jackie and the hotdog.\">Captain Jackie and the hotdog.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Nexus_of_Truth.\" title=\"The Nexus of Truth.\">The Nexus of Truth.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_cockle_children.\" title=\"The cockle children.\">The cockle children.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Le_Goose.\" title=\"Le Goose.\">Le Goose.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The gangsters of the sea.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/The_gangsters_of_the_sea..png/revision/latest?cb=20240916233539\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The gangsters of the sea.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/The_gangsters_of_the_sea..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240916233539\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/The_gangsters_of_the_sea..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240916233539 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/21/The_gangsters_of_the_sea..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240916233539 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The gangsters of the sea.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_gangsters_of_the_sea..png\" data-image-name=\"The gangsters of the sea..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_18\" title=\"Series 18\">18</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Andy_Zaltzman\" title=\"Andy Zaltzman\">Andy Zaltzman</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/...and_then_a_detective_comes_in.\" title=\"...and then a detective comes in.\">...and then a detective comes in.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27m_a_girl_who_likes_a_clean_line.\" title=\"I&#39;m a girl who likes a clean line.\">I'm a girl who likes a clean line.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The gangsters of the sea.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_18\" title=\"Series 18\">Series 18</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 26 September 2024. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Andy_Zaltzman\" title=\"Andy Zaltzman\">Andy Zaltzman</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_gangsters_of_the_sea.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> notes that <a href=\"/wiki/Babatunde_Al%C3%A9sh%C3%A9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Babatunde Aléshé\">Babatunde Aléshé</a> had \"labelled the orcas the gangsters of the sea\" after Babatunde decided to refer to an orca as a \"killer whale\" because \"that sounds gangster\", during his attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_a_rocket_in_your_pocket\" title=\"Put a rocket in your pocket\">Put a rocket in your pocket</a> task. The title card shows a cocktail, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Win_the_pub_quiz_by_cheating\" title=\"Win the pub quiz by cheating\">Win the pub quiz by cheating</a> task, decorated with a small rocket from the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_a_rocket_in_your_pocket\" title=\"Put a rocket in your pocket\">Put a rocket in your pocket</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_gangsters_of_the_sea.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Merten gangsterit', which translates as 'The gangsters of the sea'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Havets gangstere', which translates as 'The gangsters of the sea'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_gangsters_of_the_sea.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Andy_Zaltzman\" title=\"Andy Zaltzman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Andy Zaltzman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bab%C3%A1t%C3%BAnd%C3%A9_Al%C3%A9sh%C3%A9\" title=\"Babátúndé Aléshé\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Babátúndé Aléshé</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Emma_Sidi\" title=\"Emma Sidi\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Emma Sidi</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jack_Dee\" title=\"Jack Dee\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jack Dee</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Jones\" title=\"Rosie Jones\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Jones</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_object_with_the_most_soul\" title=\"The object with the most soul\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The object with the most soul.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_a_rocket_in_your_pocket\" title=\"Put a rocket in your pocket\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put a rocket in your pocket.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>If you draw, make or write your own rocket, that doesn't count as an actual rocket unless you are a rocket scientist. If you are not a rocket scientist, you must now put two rockets in your pockets.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>If you swear at any point after drawing, making or writing your own rocket, you must now put three rockets in your pockets.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Recreate_a_famous_2D_piece_of_art_in_3D\" title=\"Recreate a famous 2D piece of art in 3D\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Recreate a famous 2D piece of art in 3D.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Win_the_pub_quiz_by_cheating\" title=\"Win the pub quiz by cheating\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Win the pub quiz by cheating. If the quizmaster notices you cheating, you will lose a point and you must use a different method of cheating.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rustle_Russell,_fill_Phil,_mark_Mark,_rob_Rob_and_pat_Pat\" title=\"Rustle Russell, fill Phil, mark Mark, rob Rob and pat Pat\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Rustle Russell, fill Phil, mark Mark, rob Rob and pat Pat. When Alex blows his whistle, you must all either immediately say one word to the person next to you or perform one action. The people may only say yes or no. If you perform the wrong action, you are disqualified. You will then meet a new person.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_gangsters_of_the_sea.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>For part of his prize task, Zaltzman wore a large, orange robe in the studio, claiming to be a wizard. This resulted in him being nicknamed \"The Wizard\" for the run of the episode. This outfit was the first of four outfits Zaltzman would wear throughout the studio segments of the series that would lead up to his outfit for <a href=\"/wiki/Le_Goose.\" title=\"Le Goose.\">the final episode</a>.</li>\n<li>This episode's opening banter section is cut in the broadcast version of the episode. The section involved Greg calling Alex a knob before Alex pulls out cards parodying Channel 4's adult humour messages, saying the show contains strong adults (instead of strong language and adult humour).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_gangsters_of_the_sea.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/\"><i>The gangsters of the sea.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141529\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expi